   "titulo": "- - - - - -",
   "texto": [
    "**だけ** limits the above element: **パン だけ たべます** (as bread only). It may go with a negative or affirmative phrase, as you wish to say; it does not always require an affirmative verb."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "- - - -",
   "texto": [
    "**ばかり** usually expresses that there is a lot of one thing or that it is repeated: **ゲーム ばかり して います** (I do nothing but play). **しか** means «alone» and requires a negative form: **パン しか ありません** (there is only bread). Do not confuse **ばかり** with **〜た ばかり** («end of»)."
   ]
  },
